{% extends "base.j2" %}

{% block content %}
## Security Hardening Task
Instruction: {{ instruction }}

## Scan Findings Context
Target: {{ target | default('Workspace') }}
Total Static Findings: {{ total_findings | default(0) }}

{% if findings_summary %}
- Critical: {{ findings_summary.critical | default(0) }}
- High: {{ findings_summary.high | default(0) }}
- Medium: {{ findings_summary.medium | default(0) }}
- Masked Secrets Detected: {{ findings_summary.secrets_detected | default(0) }}
{% endif %}

{% if top_findings %}
## Top Detected Issues
{% for f in top_findings %}
- [{{ f.rule_id }}] ({{ f.severity }}) {{ f.title }} in `{{ f.file }}`:{{ f.line }}
  Snippet: `{{ f.snippet }}`
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Required Output Format
1. Threat Severity & CWE Analysis
2. Remediation Steps & Safe Patterns (with code examples)
3. Residual Risks & What Was NOT Checked
NEVER include raw secret values in output. All credentials must remain masked.
{% endblock %}
